<main class="min-h-screen bg-[#111] text-[#eee] py-32 px-6 sm:px-12 md:px-24 max-w-6xl mx-auto font-sans"><div class="mb-12"><a class="text-neutral-500 hover:text-white transition-colors" href="/">← Back to Portfolio</a></div><header class="mb-16"><h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-4 font-serif text-white">Engineering Projects</h1><p class="text-xl text-neutral-400 max-w-2xl">Deep-dive technical case studies showcasing architecture, challenges, and metrics from my top projects.</p></header><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12"><a class="group block" href="/projects/gotrip"><article class="flex flex-col h-full bg-[#1a1a1a] p-6 rounded-2xl border border-neutral-800 shadow-sm hover:border-neutral-600 transition-colors duration-300"><div class="w-full mb-6"><div class="aspect-video relative rounded-lg overflow-hidden shadow-md group-hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow duration-300 bg-neutral-900"><img alt="GoTrip" class="w-full h-full object-cover opacity-80 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity" src="/images/gotrip1.png"/></div></div><div class="flex flex-col flex-grow"><span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-blue-400 mb-2">AI Travel Tech</span><h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold mb-3 text-white leading-tight group-hover:text-blue-400 transition-colors">GoTrip</h2><p class="text-sm text-neutral-400 mb-4 line-clamp-3">GoTrip is an intelligent, end-to-end travel platform that utilizes generative AI to curate highly personalized travel itineraries, simplifying the booking and planning process for modern travelers.</p><span class="text-sm font-medium text-blue-400 flex items-center gap-1 mt-auto">Read Case Study<svg fill="none" height="14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="14"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span></div></article></a><a class="group block" href="/projects/blinkit"><article class="flex flex-col h-full bg-[#1a1a1a] p-6 rounded-2xl border border-neutral-800 shadow-sm hover:border-neutral-600 transition-colors duration-300"><div class="w-full mb-6"><div class="aspect-video relative rounded-lg overflow-hidden shadow-md group-hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow duration-300 bg-neutral-900"><img alt="Blinkit Dashboard" class="w-full h-full object-cover opacity-80 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity" src="/images/blinkit1.jpg"/></div></div><div class="flex flex-col flex-grow"><span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-blue-400 mb-2">Data Analytics</span><h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold mb-3 text-white leading-tight group-hover:text-blue-400 transition-colors">Blinkit Dashboard</h2><p class="text-sm text-neutral-400 mb-4 line-clamp-3">A comprehensive Business Intelligence dashboard designed to visualize and track key quick-commerce metrics. It enables operational teams to identify bottlenecks in delivery times and inventory turnover.</p><span class="text-sm font-medium text-blue-400 flex items-center gap-1 mt-auto">Read Case Study<svg fill="none" height="14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="14"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span></div></article></a><a class="group block" href="/projects/hr-analytics"><article class="flex flex-col h-full bg-[#1a1a1a] p-6 rounded-2xl border border-neutral-800 shadow-sm hover:border-neutral-600 transition-colors duration-300"><div class="w-full mb-6"><div class="aspect-video relative rounded-lg overflow-hidden shadow-md group-hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow duration-300 bg-neutral-900"><img alt="HR Analytics" class="w-full h-full object-cover opacity-80 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity" src="/images/hr1.png"/></div></div><div class="flex flex-col flex-grow"><span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-blue-400 mb-2">Data Analytics</span><h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold mb-3 text-white leading-tight group-hover:text-blue-400 transition-colors">HR Analytics</h2><p class="text-sm text-neutral-400 mb-4 line-clamp-3">A sophisticated analytics solution focused on human resource metrics. It provides leadership with a strategic overview of employee satisfaction, attrition risks, and diversity metrics through interactive visualizations.</p><span class="text-sm font-medium text-blue-400 flex items-center gap-1 mt-auto">Read Case Study<svg fill="none" height="14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="14"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span></div></article></a><a class="group block" href="/projects/snapverse"><article class="flex flex-col h-full bg-[#1a1a1a] p-6 rounded-2xl border border-neutral-800 shadow-sm hover:border-neutral-600 transition-colors duration-300"><div class="w-full mb-6"><div class="aspect-video relative rounded-lg overflow-hidden shadow-md group-hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow duration-300 bg-neutral-900"><img alt="SnapVerse" class="w-full h-full object-cover opacity-80 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity" src="/images/snap1.png"/></div></div><div class="flex flex-col flex-grow"><span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-blue-400 mb-2">React &amp; Node.js</span><h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold mb-3 text-white leading-tight group-hover:text-blue-400 transition-colors">SnapVerse</h2><p class="text-sm text-neutral-400 mb-4 line-clamp-3">SnapVerse is a modern, responsive social media application designed for seamless media sharing and real-time community interaction, featuring instant messaging and content moderation.</p><span class="text-sm font-medium text-blue-400 flex items-center gap-1 mt-auto">Read Case Study<svg fill="none" height="14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="14"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span></div></article></a></div></main>